{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"call_551d20c21a1d4bb084744388b421bfcf","type":"tool_result","content":[{"type":"text","text":"<canvas id=\"0:1\" name=\"00 · Start Here 设计任务\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"0\" height=\"0\">\n  <frame id=\"4:2\" name=\"Start Here · Brief\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"1440\" height=\"2964\">\n    <frame id=\"4:3\" name=\"Header\" x=\"64\" y=\"64\" width=\"1312\" height=\"145\">\n      <text id=\"4:4\" name=\"LEVEL L2 · DESIGN TASK · v2\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"182\" height=\"19\" />\n      <text id=\"4:5\" name=\"Northgate Homes — real estate website\" x=\"0\" y=\"31\" width=\"1312\" height=\"52\" />\n      <text id=\"4:6\" name=\"Design a real estate agency website: present the agency, search and browse listings, and view one property with its details and agent contact form. Desktop web, 1440 wide, light mode. Work in your own new Figma file — this file is read-only reference.\" x=\"0\" y=\"95\" width=\"1312\" height=\"50\" />\n    </frame>\n    <frame id=\"4:7\" name=\"How to work\" x=\"64\" y=\"257\" width=\"1312\" height=\"249\">\n      <text id=\"4:8\" name=\"How to work\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"147\" height=\"35\" />\n      <text id=\"4:9\" name=\"1. Build exactly the 2 frames below, named exactly as listed (one state per frame), and wire them as a clickable prototype with the listed links. 2. Everything in “Must include” must appear on that frame. The lists are grouped by subject and sorted alphabetically — they are not in page order and say nothing about layout, grouping, emphasis or styling. Those are your decisions. 3. The brand color and the typeface in 01 · Foundations are fixed. Define every other color yourself, plus type scale, spacing, radii, elevation and the page grid, and apply them consistently. 4. 02 · Components gives only a default Button and a default Text Field. Design all other states, the header, the footer, the navigation and every business component as reusable components in your file. 5. Use the logo mark, the photos, the avatars, the social logos and the icons from 04 · Media. 6. Copy and data must match “Fixed data” exactly. This brief wins over anything you may know of the original kit.\" x=\"0\" y=\"51\" width=\"1312\" height=\"198\" />\n    </frame>\n    <frame id=\"4:10\" name=\"Frames · goals · must include · links\" x=\"64\" y=\"554\" width=\"1312\" height=\"665\">\n      <text id=\"4:11\" name=\"Frames · goals · must include · links\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"413\" height=\"35\" />\n      <text id=\"4:12\" name=\"Frame names are fixed. Must-include lists are grouped by subject and sorted A–Z: they state what is on the screen, never where it goes or how it looks.\" x=\"0\" y=\"51\" width=\"1312\" height=\"22\" />\n      <frame id=\"4:13\" name=\"Frame cards\" x=\"0\" y=\"89\" width=\"1312\" height=\"576\">\n        <frame id=\"4:14\" name=\"01_Home\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"644\" height=\"556\">\n          <text id=\"4:15\" name=\"01_Home\" x=\"24\" y=\"24\" width=\"82\" height=\"26\" />\n          <text id=\"4:16\" name=\"Goal: Get to know the agency and find a home to view.\" x=\"24\" y=\"60\" width=\"596\" height=\"20\" />\n          <text id=\"4:17\" name=\"MUST INCLUDE\" x=\"24\" y=\"90\" width=\"84\" height=\"16\" />\n          <text id=\"4:18\" name=\"• Agency intro 1: “You’re in good hands” · copy (see DATA) · “Learn more” (Icon_Arrow_Right) · Photo_Agents_Meeting • Agency intro 2: “Local experts on every street” · copy (see DATA) · “Learn more” (Icon_Arrow_Right) · Photo_Agents_Meeting • Call to action: “Ready to sell your home?” · copy (see DATA) · “Learn more” (Icon_Arrow_Right) • Footer: “Make your dreams a reality” · “Work with us” (Icon_Arrow_Right) · Logo_Mark · “NORTHGATE” · Logo_Facebook · Logo_Twitter · Logo_Instagram · 3 link columns (see DATA) • Header: Logo_Mark · “NORTHGATE” wordmark · navigation Buy / Sell / Rent / About · no item current · “Work with us” (Icon_Arrow_Right) • Hero: Photo_Hero_House · “Beautiful homes made for you” · copy (see DATA) · “See all listings” (Icon_Arrow_Right) • Listings: “Find your next place to live” · search filters Looking for · Location · Property Type · Price (Icon_Chevron_Down) · 6 listing cards, each with photo, name, bedrooms (Icon_Bed), bathrooms (Icon_Bath) and area (Icon_Area) (see DATA) • Testimonial: quote (see DATA) · 3 clients, each with Avatar_Client, name and “Client” · current: Leo Madrigal\" x=\"24\" y=\"116\" width=\"596\" height=\"360\" />\n          <text id=\"4:19\" name=\"LINKS\" x=\"24\" y=\"486\" width=\"33\" height=\"16\" />\n          <text id=\"4:20\" name=\"→ See all listings, any listing card → 02_Property\" x=\"24\" y=\"512\" width=\"596\" height=\"20\" />\n        </frame>\n        <frame id=\"4:21\" name=\"02_Property\" x=\"668\" y=\"0\" width=\"644\" height=\"576\">\n          <text id=\"4:22\" name=\"02_Property\" x=\"24\" y=\"24\" width=\"110\" height=\"26\" />\n          <text id=\"4:23\" name=\"Goal: Decide whether to contact the agent about Modern House.\" x=\"24\" y=\"60\" width=\"596\" height=\"20\" />\n          <text id=\"4:24\" name=\"MUST INCLUDE\" x=\"24\" y=\"90\" width=\"84\" height=\"16\" />\n          <text id=\"4:25\" name=\"• Agent contact: Avatar_Kayley_Hall · “Kayley Hall” · “View profile” · Name · Phone · Email · Message “Hello, I am interested in…” · “Contact agent” (Icon_Arrow_Right) • Description: “Description” · 3 paragraphs (see DATA) • Details: “Details” · 4 Bedrooms (Icon_Bed) · 2 Bathrooms (Icon_Bath) · 2 Garage (Icon_Garage) · 1 Floor (Icon_Floors) · Built 2007 (Icon_Calendar) • Features: “Features” · 15 features, each with Icon_Check (see DATA) • Footer: “Make your dreams a reality” · “Work with us” (Icon_Arrow_Right) · Logo_Mark · “NORTHGATE” · Logo_Facebook · Logo_Twitter · Logo_Instagram · 3 link columns (see DATA) • Gallery: Photo_Modern_House_Main · thumbnails Photo_Modern_House_1 – Photo_Modern_House_7 · selected: none (main photo shown) • Header: Logo_Mark · “NORTHGATE” wordmark · navigation Buy / Sell / Rent / About · no item current · “Work with us” (Icon_Arrow_Right) • Similar listings: “Similar listings” · 4 listing cards, each with photo, name, bedrooms (Icon_Bed), bathrooms (Icon_Bath) and area (Icon_Area) (see DATA) · previous / next (Icon_Chevron_Left, Icon_Chevron_Right) • Title bar: “Modern House” · “3002 Foster Ave, Brooklyn, NY 11210, USA” · $450,000 · “$280/sq ft”\" x=\"24\" y=\"116\" width=\"596\" height=\"360\" />\n          <text id=\"4:26\" name=\"LINKS\" x=\"24\" y=\"486\" width=\"33\" height=\"16\" />\n          <text id=\"4:27\" name=\"→ Logo (header) → 01_Home → similar listing cards → 02_Property\" x=\"24\" y=\"512\" width=\"596\" height=\"40\" />\n        </frame>\n      </frame>\n    </frame>\n    <frame id=\"4:28\" name=\"Navigation structure\" x=\"64\" y=\"1267\" width=\"1312\" height=\"139\">\n      <text id=\"4:29\" name=\"Navigation structure\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"242\" height=\"35\" />\n      <text id=\"4:30\" name=\"• Header and footer on both frames: Logo_Mark + NORTHGATE wordmark, Buy / Sell / Rent / About, “Work with us”. No nav item is current on either frame. • Flow: 01_Home → See all listings or a listing card → 02_Property. Logo → 01_Home. • Entry only (no frame): Buy, Sell, Rent, About, Work with us, Learn more, search filters, testimonial clients, gallery thumbnails, View profile, form fields, Contact agent, similar-listing arrows, social logos, footer links.\" x=\"0\" y=\"51\" width=\"1312\" height=\"88\" />\n    </frame>\n    <frame id=\"4:31\" name=\"Fixed data &amp; copy\" x=\"64\" y=\"1454\" width=\"1312\" height=\"797\">\n      <text id=\"4:32\" name=\"Fixed data &amp; copy\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"207\" height=\"35\" />\n      <text id=\"4:33\" name=\"Use these values verbatim.\" x=\"0\" y=\"51\" width=\"1312\" height=\"22\" />\n      <frame id=\"4:34\" name=\"Data blocks\" x=\"0\" y=\"89\" width=\"1312\" height=\"708\">\n        <frame id=\"4:35\" name=\"Home copy\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"420\" height=\"258\">\n          <text id=\"4:36\" name=\"Home copy\" x=\"20\" y=\"20\" width=\"78\" height=\"20\" />\n          <text id=\"4:37\" name=\"Hero: Hand-picked homes, honest advice and a team that knows every street in the neighbourhoods we serve. You’re in good hands: Our agents have helped more than 2,000 families buy, sell and rent. We listen first, explain every step and stay with you until the keys are in your hand. Local experts on every street: We live where we work. From school catchments to the quietest blocks, we can tell you what the listing photos don’t. Ready to sell your home?: Get a free valuation and a clear plan to sell at the right price, on your timeline.\" x=\"20\" y=\"48\" width=\"380\" height=\"190\" />\n        </frame>\n        <frame id=\"4:38\" name=\"Listings (01, in order)\" x=\"444\" y=\"0\" width=\"420\" height=\"220\">\n          <text id=\"4:39\" name=\"Listings (01, in order)\" x=\"20\" y=\"20\" width=\"145\" height=\"20\" />\n          <text id=\"4:40\" name=\"Malto House · 4 bd · 2 ba · 1,650 sq ft (Photo_Listing_1) Birchwood Villa · 4 bd · 2 ba · 1,720 sq ft (Photo_Listing_2) Cedar Lane House · 4 bd · 2 ba · 1,580 sq ft (Photo_Listing_3) Harbor View Loft · 4 bd · 2 ba · 1,610 sq ft (Photo_Listing_4) Maple Court House · 4 bd · 2 ba · 1,690 sq ft (Photo_Listing_5) Willow Creek Home · 4 bd · 2 ba · 1,640 sq ft (Photo_Listing_6)\" x=\"20\" y=\"48\" width=\"380\" height=\"152\" />\n        </frame>\n        <frame id=\"4:41\" name=\"Testimonial (01)\" x=\"888\" y=\"0\" width=\"420\" height=\"163\">\n          <text id=\"4:42\" name=\"Testimonial (01)\" x=\"20\" y=\"20\" width=\"111\" height=\"20\" />\n          <text id=\"4:43\" name=\"“Kayley and the team found us a home we love in under a month. They knew every street, never pushed us, and we always felt in good hands.” Clients: Leo Madrigal · Owen Brooks · Mia Chen — each “Client”, all with Avatar_Client\" x=\"20\" y=\"48\" width=\"380\" height=\"95\" />\n        </frame>\n        <frame id=\"4:44\" name=\"Modern House (02)\" x=\"0\" y=\"282\" width=\"420\" height=\"163\">\n          <text id=\"4:45\" name=\"Modern House (02)\" x=\"20\" y=\"20\" width=\"134\" height=\"20\" />\n          <text id=\"4:46\" name=\"3002 Foster Ave, Brooklyn, NY 11210, USA · $450,000 · $280/sq ft (1,607 sq ft) Details: 4 Bedrooms · 2 Bathrooms · 2 Garage · 1 Floor · Built 2007 Agent: Kayley Hall\" x=\"20\" y=\"48\" width=\"380\" height=\"95\" />\n        </frame>\n        <frame id=\"4:47\" name=\"Description (02)\" x=\"444\" y=\"282\" width=\"420\" height=\"258\">\n          <text id=\"4:48\" name=\"Description (02)\" x=\"20\" y=\"20\" width=\"113\" height=\"20\" />\n          <text id=\"4:49\" name=\"A bright, single-storey family home on a quiet tree-lined street, a short walk from Foster Avenue’s cafés and the subway. The open-plan kitchen with a large island flows into the living and dining area, with floor-to-ceiling windows onto a private garden. Four bedrooms include a main suite with its own bathroom. Built in 2007 and updated in 2022, the house has a double garage, central air conditioning, new flooring throughout and plenty of built-in storage.\" x=\"20\" y=\"48\" width=\"380\" height=\"190\" />\n        </frame>\n        <frame id=\"4:50\" name=\"Features (02, in order)\" x=\"888\" y=\"282\" width=\"420\" height=\"144\">\n          <text id=\"4:51\" name=\"Features (02, in order)\" x=\"20\" y=\"20\" width=\"153\" height=\"20\" />\n          <text id=\"4:52\" name=\"Air conditioning · Central heating · Hardwood floors · Open-plan kitchen · Kitchen island · Dishwasher · Laundry room · Walk-in closet · En-suite bathroom · Private garden · Patio · Double garage · Security system · Solar panels · Storage room\" x=\"20\" y=\"48\" width=\"380\" height=\"76\" />\n        </frame>\n        <frame id=\"4:53\" name=\"Similar listings (02, in order)\" x=\"0\" y=\"564\" width=\"420\" height=\"144\">\n          <text id=\"4:54\" name=\"Similar listings (02, in order)\" x=\"20\" y=\"20\" width=\"194\" height=\"20\" />\n          <text id=\"4:55\" name=\"Malto House · 4 bd · 2 ba · 1,650 sq ft (Photo_Listing_1) Birchwood Villa · 4 bd · 2 ba · 1,720 sq ft (Photo_Listing_2) Cedar Lane House · 4 bd · 2 ba · 1,580 sq ft (Photo_Listing_3) Harbor View Loft · 4 bd · 2 ba · 1,610 sq ft (Photo_Listing_4)\" x=\"20\" y=\"48\" width=\"380\" height=\"76\" />\n        </frame>\n        <frame id=\"4:56\" name=\"Footer columns (both frames)\" x=\"444\" y=\"564\" width=\"420\" height=\"144\">\n          <text id=\"4:57\" name=\"Footer columns (both frames)\" x=\"20\" y=\"20\" width=\"204\" height=\"20\" />\n          <text id=\"4:58\" name=\"Company: About us · Our agents · Careers · Contact Services: Buy a home · Sell a home · Rent a home · Property management Resources: Market reports · Buyer guide · Seller guide · FAQ\" x=\"20\" y=\"48\" width=\"380\" height=\"76\" />\n        </frame>\n      </frame>\n    </frame>\n    <frame id=\"4:59\" name=\"What is fixed · what is yours\" x=\"64\" y=\"2299\" width=\"1312\" height=\"272\">\n      <text id=\"4:60\" name=\"What is fixed · what is yours\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"328\" height=\"35\" />\n      <frame id=\"4:61\" name=\"Fixed vs yours\" x=\"0\" y=\"51\" width=\"1312\" height=\"221\">\n        <frame id=\"4:62\" name=\"Fixed (given)\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"644\" height=\"221\">\n          <text id=\"4:63\" name=\"Fixed (given)\" x=\"24\" y=\"24\" width=\"103\" height=\"23\" />\n          <text id=\"4:64\" name=\"• Frame list and exact names • Must-include content per frame (what, not how) • Navigation structure and links • All data and copy • Brand color #FFAC12 and DM Sans • Media: logo mark, photos, avatars, social logos, icons • Default Button, default Text Field\" x=\"24\" y=\"57\" width=\"596\" height=\"140\" />\n        </frame>\n        <frame id=\"4:65\" name=\"Yours (designer decides)\" x=\"668\" y=\"0\" width=\"644\" height=\"221\">\n          <text id=\"4:66\" name=\"Yours (designer decides)\" x=\"24\" y=\"24\" width=\"197\" height=\"23\" />\n          <text id=\"4:67\" name=\"• Layout, grid, grouping, order and emphasis on both pages • All other colors: neutrals, text, dark sections, backgrounds / surfaces, error / disabled • Type scale, spacing, radii, elevation • All states: hover, focused field, selected thumbnail, current testimonial, open filter • Header, footer, hero, agency sections, search filter bar, listing card, testimonial, CTA band, title bar, gallery, details strip, feature list, contact form • How photos are cropped and placed\" x=\"24\" y=\"57\" width=\"596\" height=\"140\" />\n        </frame>\n      </frame>\n    </frame>\n    <frame id=\"4:68\" name=\"How it is evaluated\" x=\"64\" y=\"2619\" width=\"1312\" height=\"281\">\n      <text id=\"4:69\" name=\"How it is evaluated\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"222\" height=\"35\" />\n      <text id=\"4:70\" name=\"Your file is compared with this brief on coverage, data and flow — not on visual similarity to any original.\" x=\"0\" y=\"51\" width=\"1312\" height=\"22\" />\n      <text id=\"4:71\" name=\"1. Checklist coverage per frame 2. Data &amp; copy accuracy 3. Flow &amp; prototype completeness 4. Information hierarchy 5. Visual quality &amp; consistency of your own system 6. Component reuse 7. State design (current testimonial, selected thumbnail, focused field)\" x=\"0\" y=\"89\" width=\"1312\" height=\"154\" />\n      <text id=\"4:72\" name=\"Deliverable: the link to your own Figma file containing the 2 named frames, your components and the prototype.\" x=\"0\" y=\"259\" width=\"1312\" height=\"22\" />\n    </frame>\n  </frame>\n</canvas>"},{"type":"text","text":"IMPORTANT: After you call this tool, you MUST call get_design_context if trying to implement the design, since this tool only returns metadata. If you do not call get_design_context, the agent will not be able to implement the design."}]}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"30ea73c5-2dc2-48eb-a4ec-71b12b5e14e4","uuid":"37e4b286-2c20-4add-8f26-606800d59be1","timestamp":"2026-11-01T20:04:44.307Z","tool_use_result":{"content":[{"type":"text","text":"<canvas id=\"0:1\" name=\"00 · Start Here 设计任务\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"0\" height=\"0\">\n  <frame id=\"4:2\" name=\"Start Here · Brief\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"1440\" height=\"2964\">\n    <frame id=\"4:3\" name=\"Header\" x=\"64\" y=\"64\" width=\"1312\" height=\"145\">\n      <text id=\"4:4\" name=\"LEVEL L2 · DESIGN TASK · v2\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"182\" height=\"19\" />\n      <text id=\"4:5\" name=\"Northgate Homes — real estate website\" x=\"0\" y=\"31\" width=\"1312\" height=\"52\" />\n      <text id=\"4:6\" name=\"Design a real estate agency website: present the agency, search and browse listings, and view one property with its details and agent contact form. Desktop web, 1440 wide, light mode. Work in your own new Figma file — this file is read-only reference.\" x=\"0\" y=\"95\" width=\"1312\" height=\"50\" />\n    </frame>\n    <frame id=\"4:7\" name=\"How to work\" x=\"64\" y=\"257\" width=\"1312\" height=\"249\">\n      <text id=\"4:8\" name=\"How to work\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"147\" height=\"35\" />\n      <text id=\"4:9\" name=\"1. Build exactly the 2 frames below, named exactly as listed (one state per frame), and wire them as a clickable prototype with the listed links. 2. Everything in “Must include” must appear on that frame. The lists are grouped by subject and sorted alphabetically — they are not in page order and say nothing about layout, grouping, emphasis or styling. Those are your decisions. 3. The brand color and the typeface in 01 · Foundations are fixed. Define every other color yourself, plus type scale, spacing, radii, elevation and the page grid, and apply them consistently. 4. 02 · Components gives only a default Button and a default Text Field. Design all other states, the header, the footer, the navigation and every business component as reusable components in your file. 5. Use the logo mark, the photos, the avatars, the social logos and the icons from 04 · Media. 6. Copy and data must match “Fixed data” exactly. This brief wins over anything you may know of the original kit.\" x=\"0\" y=\"51\" width=\"1312\" height=\"198\" />\n    </frame>\n    <frame id=\"4:10\" name=\"Frames · goals · must include · links\" x=\"64\" y=\"554\" width=\"1312\" height=\"665\">\n      <text id=\"4:11\" name=\"Frames · goals · must include · links\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"413\" height=\"35\" />\n      <text id=\"4:12\" name=\"Frame names are fixed. Must-include lists are grouped by subject and sorted A–Z: they state what is on the screen, never where it goes or how it looks.\" x=\"0\" y=\"51\" width=\"1312\" height=\"22\" />\n      <frame id=\"4:13\" name=\"Frame cards\" x=\"0\" y=\"89\" width=\"1312\" height=\"576\">\n        <frame id=\"4:14\" name=\"01_Home\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"644\" height=\"556\">\n          <text id=\"4:15\" name=\"01_Home\" x=\"24\" y=\"24\" width=\"82\" height=\"26\" />\n          <text id=\"4:16\" name=\"Goal: Get to know the agency and find a home to view.\" x=\"24\" y=\"60\" width=\"596\" height=\"20\" />\n          <text id=\"4:17\" name=\"MUST INCLUDE\" x=\"24\" y=\"90\" width=\"84\" height=\"16\" />\n          <text id=\"4:18\" name=\"• Agency intro 1: “You’re in good hands” · copy (see DATA) · “Learn more” (Icon_Arrow_Right) · Photo_Agents_Meeting • Agency intro 2: “Local experts on every street” · copy (see DATA) · “Learn more” (Icon_Arrow_Right) · Photo_Agents_Meeting • Call to action: “Ready to sell your home?” · copy (see DATA) · “Learn more” (Icon_Arrow_Right) • Footer: “Make your dreams a reality” · “Work with us” (Icon_Arrow_Right) · Logo_Mark · “NORTHGATE” · Logo_Facebook · Logo_Twitter · Logo_Instagram · 3 link columns (see DATA) • Header: Logo_Mark · “NORTHGATE” wordmark · navigation Buy / Sell / Rent / About · no item current · “Work with us” (Icon_Arrow_Right) • Hero: Photo_Hero_House · “Beautiful ho